      "case": "failure",
      "summary": "A machine named disconnected mirrored events through remote sequence 41 and lost its line: the injected input.send to disconnected/t1 is machine_unreachable with last_seen_seq \"41\" and the machine as target, and ghost/t1 is not_found; nothing runs locally. The peer is added and SIGSTOPped, an input.send to peer/parent is written to its line and the peer process is killed while the call is in flight: the call settles outcome_unknown with its op_id, the roster keeps the peer and the lost machine as unreachable, a later call to peer/parent is machine_unreachable (no local fallback) and the local parent is untouched. A plugin whose program prints boom and exits 3 is a durable failed run (exit_code 3, output kept, op receipt committed), while a sibling plugin with a missing program is listed executable_missing and refused action_unavailable.",
